<title>JAPAN: Homac depressed by bleak earnings forecast.</title>
<headline>Homac depressed by bleak earnings forecast.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Homac Corp were depressed by a bleak earnings forecast in Tuesday morning trade in the over-the-counter market, brokers said.</p>
<p>At 0144 GMT, the shares were down to 2,280 yen after closing at 2,470 yen on Monday.</p>
<p>On Monday, the household products retailer revised down its parent current profit forecast for the year to February 20, 1997, to 3.68 billion yen from the previous forecast of 4.20 billion yen.</p>
